WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:31.708
After hearing the teachings on "Ashtanga Yoga"

2
00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:33.583
the eightfold path of yoga,

3
00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:35.458
Arjuna might wonder

4
00:00:35.458 --> 00:00:37.375
how he can practice this while remaining

5
00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:39.750
on the battlefield.

6
00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.250
Therefore, Lord Krishna

7
00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.000
explains to Arjuna

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.541
how he can maintain peace of mind right here,

9
00:00:46.541 --> 00:00:49.541
on this very battlefield.

10
00:00:53.958 --> 00:00:55.208
In this verse,

11
00:00:55.208 --> 00:00:58.541
Lord Krishna, presents 
the essence of his teaching

12
00:00:58.541 --> 00:01:01.666
and explains three important principles,

13
00:01:01.666 --> 00:01:02.875
which, when understood,

14
00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:04.458
can help a person attain liberation

15
00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:06.875
and peace.

16
00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:08.708
These principles act as a guide

17
00:01:08.708 --> 00:01:10.625
on the path of spiritual knowledge,

18
00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:13.625
lifting a person above material sorrows

19
00:01:13.625 --> 00:01:16.875
and leading them toward 

20
00:01:16.875 --> 00:01:20.250
true spiritual satisfaction.

21
00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:21.166
Lord Krishna is

22
00:01:21.166 --> 00:01:24.708
the enjoyer of all sacrifices and austerities

23
00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:29.125
which means (bhoktāram-yajña-tapasām)

24
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:29.916
Lord Krishna says,

25
00:01:29.916 --> 00:01:33.208
that all sacrifices and 
austerities are for Him alone,

26
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:36.166
and He is their supreme enjoyer.

27
00:01:36.166 --> 00:01:38.791
When a person understands this,

28
00:01:38.791 --> 00:01:41.583
they begin to perform actions
 not for self-interest,

29
00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:45.500
but with dedication to Lord Krishna.

30
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:49.666
This purifies their heart and mind,

31
00:01:49.666 --> 00:01:52.666
destroys their ego, and helps them advance

32
00:01:52.666 --> 00:01:56.625
on the path of devotion.

33
00:01:56.625 --> 00:01:57.791
This devotion gradually

34
00:01:57.791 --> 00:02:01.458
leads them toward liberation.

35
00:02:01.458 --> 00:02:04.458
This fact also gives hope to people

36
00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:05.041
that no matter

37
00:02:05.041 --> 00:02:06.333
who they are,

38
00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:07.416
they can connect with the Supreme

39
00:02:07.416 --> 00:02:10.541
through their actions.

40
00:02:10.541 --> 00:02:13.416
Any person can dedicate 

41
00:02:13.416 --> 00:02:16.833
their righteous actions to Lord Krishna,

42
00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:18.958
regardless of their religion,

43
00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:21.416
caste, or sect.

44
00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:22.666
In this way,

45
00:02:22.666 --> 00:02:23.541
every person 

46
00:02:23.541 --> 00:02:26.666
gets an opportunity to 
connect with Lord Krishna.

47
00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:27.750
Remember,

48
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.625
Lord Krishna is the supreme
 controller of all worlds

49
00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:34.125
which means (sarva-loka-maheśvaram)

50
00:02:34.125 --> 00:02:37.166
Lord Krishna reveals Himself 
as the supreme master and controller

51
00:02:37.166 --> 00:02:42.166
of all worlds and all deities.

52
00:02:42.166 --> 00:02:45.541
This means all worlds, no matter

53
00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:48.458
which deity governs them,

54
00:02:48.458 --> 00:02:50.541
are under Krishna's authority!

55
00:02:50.541 --> 00:02:52.666
Understanding this truth, a person

56
00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:55.375
develops a sense of complete surrender

57
00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:59.666
and realizes that nothing 
that happens in the world

58
00:02:59.666 --> 00:03:01.625
is possible without Lord Krishna's

59
00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:05.041
will and permission.

60
00:03:05.041 --> 00:03:08.416
When a person accepts the fact

61
00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:09.250
that Lord Krishna is

62
00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:12.000
the controller of the entire creation,

63
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.541
they begin to view events in life

64
00:03:14.541 --> 00:03:17.291
with equanimity.

65
00:03:17.291 --> 00:03:21.875
This eliminates worry, fear, and disappointment.

66
00:03:21.875 --> 00:03:22.750
And yes,

67
00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.500
Lord Krishna is a well-wisher

68
00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.708
of all beings

69
00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:30.666
which means (suhrdam sarva-bhūtānām)

70
00:03:30.666 --> 00:03:31.625
Lord Krishna

71
00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:35.041
is not only the supreme enjoyer and controller

72
00:03:35.041 --> 00:03:35.666
but also

73
00:03:35.666 --> 00:03:38.041
the dearest friend and well-wisher

74
00:03:38.041 --> 00:03:39.833
of every living being.

75
00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:41.041
He resides in the heart

76
00:03:41.041 --> 00:03:43.833
of every being as the Supersoul,

77
00:03:43.833 --> 00:03:46.083
providing guidance and helping

78
00:03:46.083 --> 00:03:49.541
in difficult situations.

79
00:03:49.541 --> 00:03:51.125
This quality of Lord Krishna

80
00:03:51.125 --> 00:03:54.625
demonstrates His boundless
 compassion and love.

81
00:03:54.625 --> 00:03:55.541
When a person

82
00:03:55.541 --> 00:03:58.333
internalizes the fact that Lord Krishna

83
00:03:58.333 --> 00:04:00.291
is their well-wisher,

84
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:02.333
love and trust for Him

85
00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:04.541
awaken in their heart.

86
00:04:04.541 --> 00:04:06.291
They realize that

87
00:04:06.291 --> 00:04:07.541
no matter how difficult

88
00:04:07.541 --> 00:04:09.750
the circumstances may be,

89
00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:13.541
Lord Krishna is always with them.

90
00:04:13.541 --> 00:04:16.208
With this faith, a person's fears,

91
00:04:16.208 --> 00:04:19.250
anger, and desires cease,

92
00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:22.416
and they experience deep spiritual satisfaction

93
00:04:22.416 --> 00:04:24.875
and peace.

94
00:04:24.875 --> 00:04:25.916
When a person

95
00:04:25.916 --> 00:04:29.250
fully understands these three facts—

96
00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.750
that Lord Krishna is the supreme

97
00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:34.250
enjoyer, guide, and well-wisher—

98
00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.416
they attain supreme peace.

99
00:04:37.416 --> 00:04:38.791
This peace doesn't come merely

100
00:04:38.791 --> 00:04:40.166
from the absence of material struggle

101
00:04:40.166 --> 00:04:43.625
or sorrow,

102
00:04:43.625 --> 00:04:45.875
but from the satisfaction

103
00:04:45.875 --> 00:04:50.750
that their life is safe in the shelter of Lord Krishna.

104
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.083
You keep running around

105
00:04:57.083 --> 00:05:00.083
in search of happiness in the world,

106
00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:02.250
trying to control your actions, desires,

107
00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:08.541
and results according to your wishes.

108
00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:12.750
But even after these efforts,

109
00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:17.708
you only gain disappointment.

110
00:05:17.708 --> 00:05:20.916
Do you know why?

111
00:05:20.916 --> 00:05:23.041
The reason is the selfishness

112
00:05:23.041 --> 00:05:28.500
or expectations behind your actions!

113
00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:32.125
When you act selflessly, without desire

114
00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:35.916
for personal gain,

115
00:05:35.916 --> 00:05:39.791
and dedicate your actions to me,

116
00:05:39.791 --> 00:05:44.125
believing that Lord Krishna will provide

117
00:05:44.125 --> 00:05:47.791
the appropriate result,

118
00:05:47.791 --> 00:05:51.458
your heart and mind become purified.

119
00:05:51.458 --> 00:05:56.458
Then you're no longer attached
 to success or praise,

120
00:05:56.458 --> 00:06:01.458
and you find true peace in that very moment.

121
00:06:01.458 --> 00:06:06.166
All your worries also disappear

122
00:06:06.166 --> 00:06:10.208
about whether what you thought would
 happen will actually happen or not.

123
00:06:10.208 --> 00:06:13.291
Also know that

124
00:06:13.291 --> 00:06:16.041
I am the supreme controller

125
00:06:16.041 --> 00:06:20.291
of this entire creation.

126
00:06:20.291 --> 00:06:24.666
This world may seem chaotic to you,

127
00:06:24.666 --> 00:06:27.416
and you might feel it's essential

128
00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:30.458
to keep every aspect of your life

129
00:06:30.458 --> 00:06:34.041
under your control,

130
00:06:34.041 --> 00:06:36.291
but the truth is

131
00:06:36.291 --> 00:06:40.625
that I am guiding everyone.

132
00:06:40.625 --> 00:06:43.250
Nothing happens

133
00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.041
without my permission.

134
00:06:46.041 --> 00:06:49.750
When you let go of this tendency to control

135
00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:52.458
and trust that

136
00:06:52.458 --> 00:06:55.708
I am taking care of you,

137
00:06:55.708 --> 00:06:59.125
then you will experience real peace.

138
00:06:59.125 --> 00:07:02.458
Finally, know that

139
00:07:02.458 --> 00:07:06.333
I am your true well-wisher.

140
00:07:06.333 --> 00:07:09.125
I reside in your heart and in the hearts

141
00:07:09.125 --> 00:07:12.916
of all beings.

142
00:07:12.916 --> 00:07:16.750
I always guide you,

143
00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:19.083
protect you, and I am

144
00:07:19.083 --> 00:07:22.125
always with you,

145
00:07:22.125 --> 00:07:24.208
no matter how difficult

146
00:07:24.208 --> 00:07:27.416
the circumstances may be.

147
00:07:27.416 --> 00:07:32.041
Trust in this loving relationship with me,

148
00:07:32.041 --> 00:07:36.208
and then neither will you fear the future, nor will

149
00:07:36.208 --> 00:07:37.416
anger and desires

150
00:07:37.416 --> 00:07:41.333
be able to consume you.

151
00:07:41.333 --> 00:07:45.708
This peace will neither be momentary,

152
00:07:45.708 --> 00:07:49.041
nor will it depend on material circumstances!

153
00:07:49.041 --> 00:07:52.791
Rather, it will always stay with you

154
00:07:52.791 --> 00:07:57.041
and continue to provide you with the experience

155
00:07:57.041 --> 00:08:01.500
that you are safe in my shelter.

156
00:08:06.625 --> 00:08:12.291
Conflicts typically arise in society

157
00:08:12.291 --> 00:08:13.291
because people

158
00:08:13.291 --> 00:08:17.625
try to control one another.

159
00:08:17.625 --> 00:08:19.166
Every person

160
00:08:19.166 --> 00:08:22.583
wants to establish their dominance,

161
00:08:22.583 --> 00:08:23.833
wants everything done

162
00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:28.375
according to their wishes and desires,

163
00:08:28.375 --> 00:08:32.083
and wants to gain authority over others.

164
00:08:32.083 --> 00:08:33.416
But when every person

165
00:08:33.416 --> 00:08:37.458
is engaged in the race for control,

166
00:08:37.458 --> 00:08:39.875
they disrupt the peace

167
00:08:39.875 --> 00:08:43.250
and harmony of society,

168
00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.708
and perhaps consider themselves

169
00:08:45.708 --> 00:08:49.333
the master of this world.

170
00:08:49.333 --> 00:08:52.458
But you should know

171
00:08:52.458 --> 00:08:54.625
that I am the supreme controller

172
00:08:54.625 --> 00:08:59.083
of this entire creation,

173
00:08:59.083 --> 00:09:03.458
and when you understand this truth,

174
00:09:03.458 --> 00:09:05.833
you will no longer need to establish

175
00:09:05.833 --> 00:09:10.166
dominance over others.

176
00:09:10.166 --> 00:09:11.583
When you see me as the supreme

177
00:09:11.583 --> 00:09:13.916
controller,

178
00:09:13.916 --> 00:09:17.250
you will know that competing for power

179
00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:20.375
and control is

180
00:09:20.375 --> 00:09:23.041
meaningless,

181
00:09:23.041 --> 00:09:24.333
because

182
00:09:24.333 --> 00:09:27.916
every event in this world occurs

183
00:09:27.916 --> 00:09:32.166
according to my will!

184
00:09:32.166 --> 00:09:36.666
Therefore, abandon the attachment to authority

185
00:09:36.666 --> 00:09:40.375
and be humble toward others.

186
00:09:40.375 --> 00:09:42.916
When you do this,

187
00:09:42.916 --> 00:09:46.333
love and compassion arise in your mind

188
00:09:46.333 --> 00:09:51.708
for all family members.

189
00:09:51.708 --> 00:09:54.375
You can make appropriate decisions

190
00:09:54.375 --> 00:09:57.500
that benefit everyone,

191
00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:01.083
and this very nature of yours guides the family

192
00:10:01.083 --> 00:10:05.583
on the path of happiness and peace.

193
00:10:10.708 --> 00:10:13.583
Have you ever thought about

194
00:10:13.583 --> 00:10:18.541
what the real power behind
 successful leadership is?

195
00:10:18.541 --> 00:10:20.916
Successful leadership is not

196
00:10:20.916 --> 00:10:22.333
about keeping every situation

197
00:10:22.333 --> 00:10:24.041
and organization member

198
00:10:24.041 --> 00:10:26.625
under your control,

199
00:10:26.625 --> 00:10:31.250
but about becoming a guide who is

200
00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:36.041
a well-wisher and helper to others.

201
00:10:36.041 --> 00:10:38.666
Just as I am.

202
00:10:38.666 --> 00:10:42.500
I am the supreme controller of this entire creation,

203
00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:46.500
yet I am also a well-wisher to all.

204
00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:49.583
Successful leadership means

205
00:10:49.583 --> 00:10:52.583
creating an atmosphere of trust

206
00:10:52.583 --> 00:10:56.250
and cooperation in your organization.

207
00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:58.083
You don't need to control

208
00:10:58.083 --> 00:11:02.041
every little thing.

209
00:11:02.041 --> 00:11:05.458
Instead, you should trust the members

210
00:11:05.458 --> 00:11:07.791
of your organization,

211
00:11:07.791 --> 00:11:10.083
encourage them,

212
00:11:10.083 --> 00:11:15.208
and guide them with love and understanding.

213
00:11:15.208 --> 00:11:18.750
When the members of your organization feel

214
00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:21.583
that you are working for their good,

215
00:11:21.583 --> 00:11:23.083
they follow you with complete dedication

216
00:11:23.083 --> 00:11:27.250
and commitment.

217
00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:31.041
Remember, successful leadership doesn't just

218
00:11:31.041 --> 00:11:34.208
involve the ability to make decisions,

219
00:11:34.208 --> 00:11:35.083
but it values

220
00:11:35.083 --> 00:11:39.041
every member of the organization,

221
00:11:39.041 --> 00:11:41.750
understands their problems,

222
00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:43.041
and motivates them

223
00:11:43.041 --> 00:11:46.333
to move forward.

224
00:11:46.333 --> 00:11:50.250
When you assure your organization

225
00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:53.833
that you are with them in every situation,

226
00:11:53.833 --> 00:11:54.875
they consider you

227
00:11:54.875 --> 00:11:58.250
their guide

228
00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:01.166
and work with complete dedication.

229
00:12:01.166 --> 00:12:05.125
True and successful leadership is that which

230
00:12:05.125 --> 00:12:08.708
not only focuses on results

231
00:12:08.708 --> 00:12:13.291
but also pays attention to the
 well-being and development

232
00:12:13.291 --> 00:12:16.708
of every member of the organization.
